> Is it possible to use one time point to run EFA and two time-points  to run CFA. I think about this approach beacause my sapmle size is small (62 firms for the first year, 74 for the second year and 70 for the third year)

That's a really small sample size, so I would trust EFA results unless you have like 10 highly reliable indicators for each supposed factor.  But it sounds like you already have ideas about how items load on factors at each timepoint, so I don't understand why you would be motivated to run EFA at all.

This isn't anything specific to lavaan, so SEMNET <http://www2.gsu.edu/~mkteer/semnet.html> is a better place to get feedback on this problem.

Terry

