From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Wed Mar 23 11:07:50 2016
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Wed, 23 Mar 2016 11:07:50 +0000
Subject: Re: Latent variable model with high R squares still fails X2 test
Message-ID: <fhXX9ZD4QLU.mUCNm8pCCQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <fhXX9ZD4QLU.1GHYThwMCQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
